  "adaptations": [
    "FieldWith declares current-build Content/Label/Description/Control parts and binds the real native target after the callback, allowing either declaration order.",
    "Field configuration selects thirteen documented recipes plus the ten Create sections. Field variant selects each section material configuration instead of stacking every field in the Gallery.",
    "Drafts, radio/checkbox/slider values and local saved snapshots belong to the Gallery owner. Submit/Cancel do not contact an account, payment, task or other backend.",
    "Native selects use the OS menu; styled selects use an independent desktop Flyout. The explicit Native select source section always uses the OS route.",
    "Source hash links and readonly Git tree checks establish provenance, not complete operating-system/assistive-technology/visual acceptance."
